 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In the land of Seir the mountain stood tall",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lotan and Shobal and Zibeon dwell there",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.01,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Anah and Dishon and Ezer and Dishan",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Chiefs of the Horites ruling the domain",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hemdan and Eshban and Ithran and Cheran",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sons of Dishon walking in the land",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Original people before the days were done",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Roots in the earth where the sun is set",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The descendants of Esau came with their power",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They wiped them out and took their place",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Just as Israel took the promised land",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Dispossessing those who stood in the way",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hemdan and Eshban and Ithran and Cheran",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sons of Dishon walking in the land",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Original people before the days were done",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Roots in the earth where the sun is set",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Thirty-eight years the generation passed",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The hand of the Lord against the camp",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The fighting men perished from the earth",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Until the last of the old had left",
